F calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids January to February came in under 90% of normal in 37 of those years. On the middle of the grids, April to May 2025 came in at 174% of normal and August to September 2025 came in at 39%. Every grid had its driest year in 1953, and grid 21155 got 48% of normal in 1953.</p>"}
